WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:02.020
- Well, congratulations
on your engagement.

00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:03.510
- Thank you.

00:00:03.510 --> 00:00:06.180
- And the reason why I bring
it up as well is I asked him.

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:07.810
I was like, "Well, how did you propose?"

00:00:07.810 --> 00:00:09.400
And I didn't know if you mind

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:10.730
but do you mind telling
everybody how it happened?

00:00:10.730 --> 00:00:11.860
It was beautiful.

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:14.480
- No, we didn't, I had no idea, obviously.

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:15.313
I just was like,

00:00:15.313 --> 00:00:17.720
in fact, we, I was trying
to get out of going

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:20.420
back to Oklahoma because it
was getting too complicated

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:23.150
with COVID and, the family and,

00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:25.850
and I'm like, "I think we
should just cancel the trip."

00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:27.270
You know, it was like one of those, like

00:00:27.270 --> 00:00:29.820
and then we got it all
together and we ended up going.

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:33.640
And so his sister and her
family, they were there.

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:34.810
My kids were there.

00:00:34.810 --> 00:00:37.590
And, my brother and his family.

00:00:37.590 --> 00:00:39.670
We were all there, we
always are all there.

00:00:39.670 --> 00:00:42.180
And we were gonna go see
we're building a house there.

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:44.610
So we were gonna go from
the one part of the land

00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:46.780
to the other part of the
land to go see the house.

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:49.640
And meanwhile, I guess
Blake had had this ring

00:00:49.640 --> 00:00:51.790
like ready to go for
like a couple of weeks.

00:00:51.790 --> 00:00:53.480
And he had, nobody knew.

00:00:53.480 --> 00:00:56.120
Like nobody knew, my dad
knew because on my birthday

00:00:56.120 --> 00:00:57.980
he had showed my dad and

00:00:57.980 --> 00:00:59.630
said he was gonna do it or whatever.

00:00:59.630 --> 00:01:01.380
- Oh my God, he's so old fashioned.

00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:02.730
He probably talked to your dad first.

00:01:02.730 --> 00:01:04.300
- Well, I had my birthday party.

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:07.160
And it wasn't a party, it
was a birthday COVID moment

00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:08.850
in the house when I turned,

00:01:08.850 --> 00:01:10.176
whatever it was, I turned.

00:01:10.176 --> 00:01:11.450
(laughter)

00:01:11.450 --> 00:01:12.283
And,
- 29.

00:01:13.560 --> 00:01:14.393
- And then anyways,

00:01:14.393 --> 00:01:17.047
so we got there and everybody was like,

00:01:17.047 --> 00:01:18.190
"No, we gotta get back.

00:01:18.190 --> 00:01:20.910
We're cooking like a hobo stew on the fire

00:01:20.910 --> 00:01:22.597
and we can't let it burn"
and my son was like,

00:01:22.597 --> 00:01:24.850
"No, I gotta go to the
bathroom, I don't wanna go."

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:27.260
And like, it was like all
these things happening.

00:01:27.260 --> 00:01:28.890
And, I walked in.

00:01:28.890 --> 00:01:32.140
And my son was like sitting
right by this like fireplace

00:01:32.140 --> 00:01:34.200
and Blake basically like was

00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:36.027
getting down on his knees
to do a fire and he goes,

00:01:36.027 --> 00:01:37.800
"Hey, can you look in
that cabinet over there

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:39.930
and get me a fire starter."

00:01:39.930 --> 00:01:42.567
So I opened the cabinet and
there was like a ring in a box.

00:01:42.567 --> 00:01:43.678
And I was like, "Oh!"

00:01:43.678 --> 00:01:45.860
Like "What, are you serious?"

00:01:45.860 --> 00:01:48.910
And then, so everybody
like, came running around.

00:01:48.910 --> 00:01:50.850
'Cause I guess they heard
us screaming or whatever

00:01:50.850 --> 00:01:52.300
and crying and,

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:54.350
so there was no video, it was just like

00:01:54.350 --> 00:01:56.770
my sister-in-law to be was
just like shooting pictures.

00:01:56.770 --> 00:01:59.230
And that's that photo that we put out, so

00:01:59.230 --> 00:02:00.390
it was a pretty magical moment--

00:02:00.390 --> 00:02:02.430
- It's kinda cool that it's not on video.

00:02:02.430 --> 00:02:03.410
I mean, I know you might want it,

00:02:03.410 --> 00:02:04.243
but at the same time,

00:02:04.243 --> 00:02:06.350
I feel like our lives are always videoed

00:02:06.350 --> 00:02:07.260
and always have--

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:09.580
- Kelly, it's not cool
that it's not on video.

00:02:09.580 --> 00:02:10.633
No, I'm just kidding.

00:02:12.417 --> 00:02:13.960
- But it was amazing.

00:02:13.960 --> 00:02:18.148
And are you aware that your fiance now.

00:02:18.148 --> 00:02:21.050
- This is so, I feel like I'm
having like a weird moment,

00:02:21.050 --> 00:02:23.980
like, I'm on your show, we're
talking about my engagement.

00:02:23.980 --> 00:02:25.120
Like, it's just like what?

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:26.510
- No, and here's the thing,

00:02:26.510 --> 00:02:29.530
you're engaged, to this guy who was

00:02:29.530 --> 00:02:32.227
a beautiful pageant queen or King.

00:02:32.227 --> 00:02:34.477
(laughter)

00:02:35.312 --> 00:02:38.360
(cross talking)

00:02:38.360 --> 00:02:41.728
So a pageant King, you, this is your love.

00:02:41.728 --> 00:02:42.790
Look at that.

00:02:42.790 --> 00:02:44.880
Oh my God, he's so cute!

00:02:44.880 --> 00:02:45.760
Oh my God, that's funny.

00:02:45.760 --> 00:02:46.910
That's my nickname, Turbo.

00:02:46.910 --> 00:02:48.010
He's wearing a turbo jacket.

00:02:48.010 --> 00:02:48.923
That's so funny, I didn't know this.

00:02:48.923 --> 00:02:50.080
- Really, I didn't know
that was your nickname.

00:02:50.080 --> 00:02:51.850
- Well, my brother named me Turbo

00:02:51.850 --> 00:02:54.170
because I never shut up and I talk a lot.

00:02:54.170 --> 00:02:55.620
Well, it stick, it stuck, so.

